<Box style={{ height:462, flexDirection:'column', gap:18 }}><Box style={{ height:240, flexDirection:'row', gap:36 }}><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>需求—设计—测试追踪</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>32 项 FR 逐条映射到接口编号、数据表、用例组与验证方法<br />例：FR-01 注册登录 → A1 / A2 → user_account → TC-AC → T<br />阶段 9 WBS 任务 157–166，甘特图 ID 与 SDP 表 7-5 逐项一致<br />9.2 总体设计 11-15—11-16；9.3 详细设计；9.6 文档审查</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>设计基线 D1 七项产物</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>总体设计报告 V1.0（2026-11-14，主文档）<br />SDP V1.9、甘特图 .gan、WBS 图 PNG（同日）<br />接口文档 V1.5（43 接口契约）、SRS V1.5（32 FR / 12 NFR）<br />高保真交互原型 v1.2（11-08，11-14 同步契约）</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height:204, flexDirection:'column', gap:0 }}><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>一致性规则</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>名称、起止、工期在 SDP、WBS 图与甘特图三处一致</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>变更控制</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>接口、表结构或统计口径变更须在同一 PR 内同步文档</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>配置管理</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>GitHub 功能分支 + Pull Request，合入需 1 个 Approve</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>后续节点</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>M5 12-02 APK、M6 验收、M7 结项材料沿用同一套编号</Text></Box></Box></Box>
